# A34 TOUCHDOWN regression: a short Bixby (open-terminal) inside its 400 ms
# double-press window followed by a Power press must NOT emit open-terminal on
# the next tick.  Reproduced the old failure: A33 emitted open-terminal at 700.
0 key bixby 1
60 key bixby 0
80 key power 1
280 key power 0
700 tick
